      "current_basis_id": "CURRENT:EO:11145#0",
      "current_legal_basis": "The held original text of EO 11145 (29 FR 3189) states no end. The U.S. Code (release point 119-121, current through 2026-10-09; laws of 2026-10-10 to 2026-10-14 not reflected) prints the order, as amended by Ex. Ord. No. 11565, as a note at 3 U.S.C. 110 (CURRENT:EO:11145#0), and the 5 U.S.C. 1013 note prints Executive Order 14354 (September 29, 2025), whose section 1(a) continues the Committee for the Preservation of the White House, Executive Order 11145 as amended, until September 30, 2027, a period that covers 2026-10-14; the held text of Executive Order 14354 is in the packet. current-law:ecfr has 0 hits and no held instrument revokes or supersedes the order. Checked through 2026-10-14.",
      "effective_date": null,
      "effective_date_confirmed": false,
      "end_id": null,
      "later_event_ids": [],
      "later_events": [],
      "reason": "Section 1(a) establishes a Curator of the White House to assist in the preservation and protection of the furniture, fixtures and decorative objects in the principal ground-floor corridor, the first-floor public rooms and other areas the President designates. It has no end date, no held instrument amends or ends it, and the Code note still prints the order, so it is operative on 2026-10-14.",
      "scope_id": "EO:11145#sec1",
      "state": "operative"
    },
