      "end_id": null,
      "later_event_ids": [],
      "later_events": [],
      "reason": "Section 1(b) requires the Curator to report to the President and make recommendations on articles, fixtures and objects to be declared of historic or artistic interest under section 2 of the Act of September 22, 1961. It has no end date, no held instrument amends or ends it, and the Code note still prints the order, so it is operative on 2026-10-14.",
