      "reason": "Section 3(a) directs the Committee to report to the President and advise the Director of the National Park Service on the museum character of the principal corridor and public rooms, and to recommend articles, furnishings, decor and arrangements. Each biennial continuation order since 1975, listed as a later event with its signing date, continued the Committee without changing this provision; the latest, Executive Order 14354 (2025), continues it until September 30, 2027. The Committee's functions continue with it, so the clause is operative on 2026-10-14.",
